OL,3,AMet Police says letter with claims
OL,4,Aabout Meghan's father not shared with
OL,5,Aother law enforcement
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt was reported on Friday that images
OL,8,Fof child sexual abuse allegedly
OL,9,Fbelonging to Thomas Markle, 82, had
OL,10,Fbeen found in his former home in the
OL,11,FPhilippines. Markle, who is based in
OL,12,Fthe US, denies possessing any such
OL,13,Fimages.
OL,15,FOn Friday, Meghan said she was informed
OL,16,Fabout "disturbing allegations" about
OL,17,Fher estranged father in 2018. The Met
OL,18,Fsaid it was reviewing the matter and
OL,19,Fdeciding whether to refer itself to the
OL,20,Fpolice watchdog.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/40
