OL,3,ATravel disrupted and events cancelled
OL,4,Aas Storm Boelo hits UK with wind and
OL,5,Arain
OL,6,
OL,7,FOne couple, stuck in Guernsey, tell us
OL,8,F"it's been incredibly stressful" after
OL,9,Ftheir flight home to Gatwick airport
OL,10,Fwas cancelled
OL,12,FThe Met Office has issued six weather
OL,13,Fwarnings covering much of the UK
OL,14,Fbetween Saturday and Sunday - three are
OL,15,Falready in effect, while amber warnings
OL,16,Ffor wind begin at 21:00
OL,18,FThis satellite image, shared by the
OL,19,Fweather agency, shows Storm Boelo as
OL,20,Fseen from space
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/40
