OL,3,APalestinian families displaced as
OL,4,AIsraeli forces demolish Hebron homes,
OL,5,Alocal officials say
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Israeli military has launched a
OL,8,Fsweeping crackdown in the occupied West
OL,9,FBank, demolishing homes and businesses
OL,10,Fin the city of Hebron and displacing
OL,11,Fhundreds of families, according to
OL,12,Flocal officials.
OL,14,FFootage shared online showed
OL,15,Fdestruction caused by Israeli
OL,16,Fbulldozers, with at least one whole
OL,17,Fstreet appearing to have been
OL,18,Fflattened. The military has also
OL,19,Fcordoned off the city, heavily
OL,20,Frestricting the movement of its 200,000
OL,21,Fresidents.
OL,23,APub: 24-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/40
